# The quit confirmation: the message box with the game logo, a 640 x 480 dialog centred on a 40% scrim. Button slots as
# in MessageBox.layout (slot 1 right, slot 3 left). The unnamed rule under the title is matched by its legacy rect.
hide at:248,135,555,136
scrim
window $MessageBoxParent centre middle 0 0 640 480 dialog
window $StaticTextTitle left top 664 324 592 32 section
window $Logo left top 688 372 544 176
window $StaticTextMessage left top 664 572 592 96 body
window $ButtonCancel left top 664 712 180 44 button
window $ButtonNo left top 870 712 180 44 button
window $ButtonOk left top 1076 712 180 44 primary
window $ButtonYes left top 1076 712 180 44 primary
